From: Michael Webster <miketwebster@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 19:57:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] wayland/dma-buf: Implement zwp_linux_dmabuf_v1 feedback
 (v4)

Backported somewhat from mutter.

Supersedes wl_drm and brings full acceleration support.

(cherry picked from commit 4e4de5ff25619207fd2f53a4636bc3f6229adede)
